[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940780315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116595#issuecomment-3940780315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116595","id":3940780315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q44kb","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T11:49:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T11:49:50Z","body":"This might depend a lot on the order on which engine events are processed (both input and process).\n\nBut if a queue_free() is used in the input loop, I indeed would not expect another iteration of that input loop to run, before the object is actually freed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940780315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941376144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116595#issuecomment-3941376144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116595","id":3941376144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q7KCQ","user":{"login":"Paperzlel","id":123300405,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1lqNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123300405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel","html_url":"https://github.com/Paperzlel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T17:05:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T17:05:41Z","body":"Looking at this issue, it seems that the `Control` is queued to be freed, but since it's not removed from the tree by this process it can still handle events during that time, which in this case causes an error. The easiest fix for this is just to call `get_parent().remove_child(self)` (or `GetParent()?.RemoveChild(this)` for C#) prior to `queue_free()` and the inputs won't pass upwards.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941376144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]